    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PUNNYAN is a falling puzzle and merge game to enjoy together with cute cats living on the Nyanten Island!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is easy to play with simple controls, but with the addition of original rules, a new puzzle experience awaits you, requiring a deep strategy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can enjoy the game in your favorite style, whether you want to master the game by yourself or have a lot of fun playing against other players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Mode Descriptions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PUNYAN by yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000This is a mode in which you can aim for a high score by yourself. Compete with players from all over the world in the online ranking!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Single Play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000This is an offline-only mode where up to 4 players can enjoy cooperative or competitive play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Simple Battle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000Send \u201cObstacle Bone\u201d to your opponent by erasing \u201cPUNYAN\u201d! The winner is the one who doesn't spill any \u201cPUNYAN\u201d or \u201cObstacle Bone\u201d until the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Rotation Battle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000The winner is the one who takes turns and does not spill any \u201cPUNYAN\u201d until the end of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Coop Play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000Each player fires a \u201cPUNYAN\u201d! Players can cooperate with each other and aim for a high score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0NonStop Battle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000The winner is the one who does not spill any \u201cPUNYAN\u201d until the end of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Speed Battle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000The first player to create the largest \u201cPUNYAN\u201d on the island, \u201cTENOU\u201d, the fastest wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0PICTURE BOOK</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000This is an illustrated book function that provides information on the 10 attractive PUNYAN characters that live on Nyanten Island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope that the time you spend with the PUNYAN will be a new pleasure for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PUNNYAN is a falling puzzle and merge game to enjoy together with cute cats living on the Nyanten Island!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is easy to play with simple controls, but with the addition of original rules, a new puzzle experience awaits you, requiring a deep strategy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can enjoy the game in your favorite style, whether you want to master the game by yourself or have a lot of fun playing against other players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Mode Descriptions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PUNYAN by yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000This is a mode in which you can aim for a high score by yourself. Compete with players from all over the world in the online ranking!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Single Play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000This is an offline-only mode where up to 4 players can enjoy cooperative or competitive play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Simple Battle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000Send \u201cObstacle Bone\u201d to your opponent by erasing \u201cPUNYAN\u201d! The winner is the one who doesn't spill any \u201cPUNYAN\u201d or \u201cObstacle Bone\u201d until the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Rotation Battle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000The winner is the one who takes turns and does not spill any \u201cPUNYAN\u201d until the end of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Coop Play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000Each player fires a \u201cPUNYAN\u201d! Players can cooperate with each other and aim for a high score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0NonStop Battle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000The winner is the one who does not spill any \u201cPUNYAN\u201d until the end of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Speed Battle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000The first player to create the largest \u201cPUNYAN\u201d on the island, \u201cTENOU\u201d, the fastest wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0PICTURE BOOK</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000This is an illustrated book function that provides information on the 10 attractive PUNYAN characters that live on Nyanten Island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope that the time you spend with the PUNYAN will be a new pleasure for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
